us: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e os hor\u00e1rios de partida dos Trilhos do Endov\u00e9lico 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os Trilhos do Endov\u00e9lico 2026 realizam-se no domingo, 29 de novembro de 2026, com partidas no Castelo de Terena: Trail Longo 30 km \u00e0s 09:00, Trail Sprint 20 km \u00e0s 09:30, Mini Trail 12 km \u00e0s 09:40 e Caminhada 10 km \u00e0s 09:45.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde funcionam o secretariado, a partida e a meta da prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As partidas s\u00e3o dadas junto ao Castelo de Terena, enquanto o secretariado no domingo (07:30 \u00e0s 09:35), a linha de meta, os banhos e o almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio funcionam no Campo de Jogos Jos\u00e9 Vitorino, na Vila de Terena, concelho do Alandroal (\u00c9vora).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, altimetrias e tempos limite oficiais?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento inclui o Trail Longo de 30 km (1219m D+, limite de 6h30), o Trail Sprint de 20 km (880m D+, limite de 5h00), o Mini Trail de 12 km (354m D+, limite de 4h00) e uma Caminhada n\u00e3o competitiva de 10 km.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o nos Trilhos do Endov\u00e9lico 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na 1\u00aa fase (at\u00e9 30 de setembro) os valores s\u00e3o de 20 \u20ac (30 km), 18 \u20ac (20 km), 15 \u20ac (12 km) e 8 \u20ac (Caminhada). Na 2\u00aa fase (de 1 de outubro a 15 de novembro) os pre\u00e7os passam para 25 \u20ac (30 km), 23 \u20ac (20 km), 20 \u20ac (12 km) e 10 \u20ac (Caminhada).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza os Trilhos do Endov\u00e9lico e que material \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 coorganizada pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Alandroal United e pelo Munic\u00edpio de Alandroal. No Trail Longo (30 km) e Trail Sprint (20 km) \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar telem\u00f3vel operacional, manta de sobreviv\u00eancia, apito e reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trilhos do Endov\u00e9lico 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-29\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-29\", \